# Python 3.11 baseline

The package requires **[Python 3.11](https://docs.python.org/3.11/)** or newer (`requires-python >= 3.11`).

- Do not introduce constructs whose only purpose is compatibility with interpreters below 3.11.
- Resolve forward references with string annotations (`"MyClass"`) or `typing.TYPE_CHECKING` imports when appropriate.
